<title>USA: Trident sees q4 net of about $0.13/sh.</title>
<headline>Trident sees q4 net of about $0.13/sh.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trident Microsystems Inc expects to report a fourth quarter net profit of about $1.8 million, or $0.13 per share, a company spokesman said Friday.</p>
<p>He said that compared with earnings of $1.6 million or $0.12 per share in the year-ago fourth quarter, but was well below the profit of $0.32 per share it had forecast at the start of the current quarter.</p>
</text>
